{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/compare/main...2b20a436e7249e7eb688f0c9caf26ad9179fc680","html_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/compare/main...2b20a436e7249e7eb688f0c9caf26ad9179fc680","permalink_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/compare/OISF:5c7787e...OISF:2b20a43","diff_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/compare/main...2b20a436e7249e7eb688f0c9caf26ad9179fc680.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/compare/main...2b20a436e7249e7eb688f0c9caf26ad9179fc680.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"5c7787ed61adb1aa7a26c23e093992350fc97d62","node_id":"C_kwDOAFKNutoAKDVjNzc4N2VkNjFhZGIxYWE3YTI2YzIzZTA5Mzk5MjM1MGZjOTdkNjI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Victor Julien","email":"vjulien@oisf.net","date":"2026-11-17T15:43:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Victor Julien","email":"vjulien@oisf.net","date":"2026-11-18T14:24:01Z"},"message":"github-ci: install pkgconf in msys2 builds\n\nMSYS2 dropped pkgconf, together with make and gdb-multiarch, from the\nmingw-w64 toolchain group. The msys2 jobs only got pkg-config and its\npkg.m4 through that group, so aclocal no longer finds\nPKG_PROG_PKG_CONFIG and autoconf aborts with a misleading:\n\n    configure.ac:221: error: possibly undefined macro: AC_DEFINE\n\nInstall pkgconf explicitly in the MINGW64 and UCRT64 jobs. make is\nalready listed by name.","tree":{"sha":"f694d1b2aa049a1ca586f3fef02f3924eeb88c9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/git/trees/f694d1b2aa049a1ca586f3fef02f3924eeb88c9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/git/commits/5c7787ed61adb1aa7a26c23e093992350fc97d62","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/commits/5c7787ed61adb1aa7a26c23e093992350fc97d62","html_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/commit/5c7787ed61adb1aa7a26c23e093992350fc97d62","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/commits/5c7787ed61adb1aa7a26